WEBVTT

00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:07.470
I can't finish reading the magazine pages

00:00:09.390 --> 00:00:14.380
I get the feeling that I must read it

00:00:16.270 --> 00:00:21.130
Game cartridges are stacked in the corner of the room

00:00:23.080 --> 00:00:27.830
Is there no meaning if I don't play them?

00:00:30.060 --> 00:00:32.930
You're on the other side of the table

00:00:33.380 --> 00:00:36.300
I'm talking to you, but...

00:00:36.900 --> 00:00:43.230
You don't change your facial expression at all

00:00:44.170 --> 00:00:49.480
Even though I'm this close to you

00:00:49.980 --> 00:00:56.750
These feelings don't reach you, don't reach you

00:00:57.170 --> 00:01:03.490
What is truly precious?

00:01:13.140 --> 00:01:18.420
Since you have no cards left, you lose.

00:01:18.620 --> 00:01:20.430
Mind Card!

00:01:25.180 --> 00:01:29.030
I sealed your mind inside this card.

00:01:29.240 --> 00:01:33.400
Pegasus, I will defeat you with my own hands!

00:01:35.840 --> 00:01:40.950
The championship tournament will take place tomorrow morning in this Duel Ring!

00:01:41.510 --> 00:01:48.820
Out of you four, the winning duelist will earn the great privilege of dueling me!

00:01:49.320 --> 00:01:57.830
Yugi boy, even if you possess the Millennium Puzzle, it's powerless against my Millennium Eye.

00:01:58.460 --> 00:02:04.470
Night Before the Battle!
Pegasus's Secret

00:02:16.700 --> 00:02:19.000
Dee-lish!

00:02:19.000 --> 00:02:20.180
I'm glad to be alive!

00:02:20.400 --> 00:02:25.750
Please relax tonight before tomorrow's finals.

00:02:25.750 --> 00:02:29.190
Enjoy our modest offerings for dinner.

00:02:29.190 --> 00:02:32.200
I have an announcement for you.

00:02:33.460 --> 00:02:40.540
In order to participate in the final tournament, you need these cards that we gave to all entrants.

00:02:40.650 --> 00:02:46.040
You need Glory of the King's Hand and Glory of the King's Opposite Hand.

00:02:46.280 --> 00:02:47.810
Those cards?

00:02:48.060 --> 00:02:52.800
You cannot receive the prize money without Glory of the King's Hand.

00:02:52.800 --> 00:02:57.820
You cannot challenge Pegasus without Glory of the King's Opposite Hand.

00:02:58.160 --> 00:03:00.590
I don't have either one!

00:03:01.300 --> 00:03:02.640
This is bad.

00:03:02.640 --> 00:03:06.830
I sneaked into the tournament, so I don't have them.  What should I do?

00:03:07.040 --> 00:03:08.650
One more thing.

00:03:08.650 --> 00:03:11.180
Please look at your soup.

00:03:14.660 --> 00:03:16.410
What is that?

00:03:16.940 --> 00:03:18.680
There's nothing in mine.

00:03:18.920 --> 00:03:22.150
Hey!  You were trying to make us eat them?

00:03:22.350 --> 00:03:25.080
Please open them.

00:03:32.300 --> 00:03:33.520
What's this?

00:03:37.500 --> 00:03:41.630
I'll now reveal the matchups for the final tournament.

00:03:41.860 --> 00:03:44.940
I wonder who's going to duel who?

00:03:45.340 --> 00:03:48.610
No matter who I face, I promise to win to the end.

00:03:49.720 --> 00:03:52.310
Please don't match me up with Yugi!

00:04:00.550 --> 00:04:02.250
Who has C?

00:04:02.250 --> 00:04:03.250
Me.

00:04:03.250 --> 00:04:04.350
You, huh?

00:04:04.350 --> 00:04:06.320
You're an acceptable opponent.

00:04:06.580 --> 00:04:09.360
You won't be so confident later on.

00:04:10.840 --> 00:04:12.500
I'm dueling you, Mai.

00:04:12.500 --> 00:04:14.900
Yugi, I won't go easy on you.

00:04:15.100 --> 00:04:17.800
Yeah.  I'll also battle with all my might.

00:04:19.540 --> 00:04:21.500
Allow me to summarize.

00:04:21.500 --> 00:04:28.620
The first round is Yugi Muto vs Mai Kujaku and Bandit Keith vs Katsuya Jonouchi.

00:04:28.620 --> 00:04:32.320
Please enjoy the rest of your meal.

00:04:36.490 --> 00:04:40.220
What a beautiful sunset.

00:04:41.480 --> 00:04:43.560
I'm stuffed.

00:04:43.780 --> 00:04:45.830
I can't eat another bite.

00:04:45.830 --> 00:04:49.200
How could you eat after seeing that floating eyeball?

00:04:49.200 --> 00:04:50.500
Jonouchi.

00:04:51.440 --> 00:04:55.610
We both have to win until we can face Pegasus in the championship.

00:04:56.440 --> 00:04:57.420
Right.

00:04:58.040 --> 00:05:01.050
But I don't have those cards.

00:05:02.210 --> 00:05:07.940
When we came to this island, we divided a single player's amount of Star Chips between us.

00:05:08.700 --> 00:05:09.850
Yugi!

00:05:10.150 --> 00:05:12.020
Yugi, you...

00:05:12.250 --> 00:05:17.030
So Glory of the King's Hand belongs to you.

00:05:17.920 --> 00:05:18.900
But...

00:05:19.120 --> 00:05:26.070
If we win our way to the championship, you take the reward money for your sister Shizuka.

00:05:26.250 --> 00:05:27.570
Yugi...

00:05:27.700 --> 00:05:35.850
I'll take Glory of the King's Opposite Hand so I can defeat Pegasus and get my grandpa back.

00:05:36.200 --> 00:05:37.500
Yugi...

00:05:37.500 --> 00:05:38.720
I see.

00:05:39.060 --> 00:05:41.560
Thanks, Yugi.  I'll take it.

00:05:42.560 --> 00:05:45.440
I'm going to get some rest.

00:05:45.650 --> 00:05:49.230
Yugi, I'm looking forward to our duel tomorrow.

00:05:51.360 --> 00:05:53.630
Good night, everyone.

00:05:53.840 --> 00:05:55.630
Good night.

00:05:56.520 --> 00:05:57.450
Good night-

00:05:57.450 --> 00:05:58.300
Yugi...

00:05:59.140 --> 00:06:02.700
Let's definitely get the glory tomorrow!

00:06:04.400 --> 00:06:05.400
Good night.

00:06:05.400 --> 00:06:06.650
Good night, Anzu.

00:06:06.650 --> 00:06:08.440
Promise you'll win, Yugi!

00:06:09.050 --> 00:06:09.680
See ya.

00:06:18.560 --> 00:06:24.630
Grandpa, Kaiba and Mokuba, I promise to save you.

00:06:26.700 --> 00:06:30.700
Yugi, it's finally time for us to settle things.

00:06:31.960 --> 00:06:34.670
I promise to defeat you.

00:06:40.200 --> 00:06:42.650
Shizuka!

00:06:48.880 --> 00:06:49.920
Yes?

00:06:53.000 --> 00:06:54.000
What's up?

00:06:54.000 --> 00:06:55.400
Do you have a second?

00:06:55.400 --> 00:06:57.900
Honda, let's forget about this.

00:06:57.900 --> 00:06:58.960
That's enough!

00:07:00.700 --> 00:07:04.470
What?  Kaiba lost because of cheating?

00:07:04.740 --> 00:07:10.220
Yeah.  Judging by Pegasus's actions up to now, I think it's a possibility.

00:07:10.720 --> 00:07:12.070
You're right.

00:07:12.070 --> 00:07:16.900
I'm going to check because we're in enemy territory.

00:07:16.900 --> 00:07:21.580
I won't be surprised if they have all sorts of gadgets to give them the advantage.

00:07:21.800 --> 00:07:25.700
Yugi will be at a handicap from the start.

00:07:25.700 --> 00:07:28.190
Can we let that happen, Anzu?

00:07:28.190 --> 00:07:31.590
If you're right, definitely not.

00:07:31.700 --> 00:07:32.700
Yeah!

00:07:32.700 --> 00:07:37.600
So if there's some trick, we'll find it and let everyone know.

00:07:37.820 --> 00:07:40.820
So that everyone can duel fair and square.

00:07:40.820 --> 00:07:44.370
But we'll be in trouble if they catch us before we find any proof.

00:07:44.720 --> 00:07:50.900
Yugi needs to rest before the tournament, so it's up to us.

00:07:50.900 --> 00:07:52.380
Will you help me?

00:07:52.600 --> 00:07:53.650
Okay.

00:07:58.780 --> 00:08:00.120
Yugi...

00:08:01.400 --> 00:08:02.800
Yugi...

00:08:04.480 --> 00:08:06.660
Can it be?  I heard Grandpa's voice!

00:08:08.060 --> 00:08:11.170
Yugi, I'm over here.

00:08:11.400 --> 00:08:13.340
Grandpa, where are you?

00:08:13.900 --> 00:08:16.170
Yugi, save me.

00:08:22.040 --> 00:08:23.450
Check carefully.

00:08:23.450 --> 00:08:25.680
There must be a hidden camera or something.

00:08:26.050 --> 00:08:27.800
There's nothing here.

00:08:27.800 --> 00:08:31.800
Maybe Pegasus did beat Kaiba using skill instead of cheating.

00:08:31.800 --> 00:08:33.790
I don't believe that.

00:08:34.260 --> 00:08:39.130
Because I cheat when I have a test that I can't afford to fail.

00:08:39.860 --> 00:08:41.200
Uhh...

00:08:45.400 --> 00:08:46.030
Huh?

00:08:46.660 --> 00:08:47.800
What is it?

00:08:47.800 --> 00:08:48.800
Look.

00:08:50.660 --> 00:08:52.410
Did you find something?

00:08:57.550 --> 00:08:59.100
This light...

00:08:59.100 --> 00:09:01.320
Moonlight is coming in.

00:09:01.740 --> 00:09:04.320
Honda, stand over there.

00:09:04.960 --> 00:09:07.590
Just like how Kaiba was standing.

00:09:16.960 --> 00:09:18.400
What's this?

00:09:18.750 --> 00:09:20.800
Bingo!  I can see a tower!

00:09:21.220 --> 00:09:25.310
If he hid a camera inside the Duel Ring, there's a high risk that it will be discovered.

00:09:25.750 --> 00:09:31.810
So he used a telescope to see his opponent's cards through this hole from the tower.

00:09:32.860 --> 00:09:34.950
I knew he was cheating.

00:09:35.180 --> 00:09:38.350
He could easily conceal an earpiece under his long hair.

00:09:38.550 --> 00:09:42.120
There must be spying equipment at the top of that tower.

00:09:42.120 --> 00:09:45.130
Let's go to the tower and find proof.

00:09:45.130 --> 00:09:47.760
What?  Isn't that a bit extreme?

00:09:48.680 --> 00:09:50.130
Just follow me.

00:09:50.570 --> 00:09:51.680
Grandpa!

00:09:52.800 --> 00:09:54.150
Yugi...

00:09:54.650 --> 00:09:57.050
This way.  I'm in pain.

00:09:57.050 --> 00:09:59.340
Hurry and save me.

00:09:59.340 --> 00:10:00.540
Grandpa!

00:10:31.760 --> 00:10:33.310
I found something useful.

00:10:34.460 --> 00:10:35.650
You're not planning to-

00:10:35.650 --> 00:10:38.080
Don't worry.  Leave it to me.

00:10:41.280 --> 00:10:45.220
I'll need to use every strategy to defeat Yugi.

00:10:50.680 --> 00:10:53.330
But he's not perfect.

00:10:53.660 --> 00:10:56.580
He must have a weak point that I can exploit.

00:11:07.520 --> 00:11:10.180
Grandpa, where are you?

00:11:10.180 --> 00:11:11.360
Answer me!

00:11:11.360 --> 00:11:12.400
Yugi...

00:11:12.800 --> 00:11:14.640
I'm over here.

00:11:16.880 --> 00:11:19.860
Yugi, I wanted to see you.

00:11:19.860 --> 00:11:23.420
I'm in pain.  Hurry and let me out of here.

00:11:23.880 --> 00:11:26.430
How, Grandpa?

00:11:46.240 --> 00:11:49.640
Instead of covering my mouth, stop me from falling in the first place!

00:11:49.640 --> 00:11:50.620
Let's hurry.

00:11:50.750 --> 00:11:51.520
Sheesh!

00:11:52.580 --> 00:11:54.520
I knew this was a bad idea.

00:11:54.700 --> 00:11:59.430
Grandpa, I don't know how to free you.

00:11:59.900 --> 00:12:03.200
Help me.  I'm in pain, Yugi!

00:12:04.620 --> 00:12:06.200
How do I free him?

00:12:10.840 --> 00:12:11.980
Grandpa!

00:12:19.500 --> 00:12:22.050
Kaiba and Mokuba.

00:12:22.600 --> 00:12:24.690
Get me out of here.

00:12:25.000 --> 00:12:27.250
Save me, Yugi!

00:12:33.240 --> 00:12:36.140
Okay.  Anzu, you climb first.

00:12:36.140 --> 00:12:39.900
That way, we can help you if you're about to fall.

00:12:39.900 --> 00:12:41.300
What?  No way!

00:12:41.980 --> 00:12:43.000
Why?

00:12:43.000 --> 00:12:44.980
You don't know why?

00:12:47.020 --> 00:12:48.460
What is it?

00:12:51.100 --> 00:12:53.160
Boys have to climb first!

00:12:53.160 --> 00:12:57.780
No, you can't go last.  If you fall, we can't save you.

00:12:57.780 --> 00:12:59.590
Then what should we do?

00:12:59.930 --> 00:13:01.530
It hurts.

00:13:01.530 --> 00:13:03.760
Yugi, save us!

00:13:03.980 --> 00:13:06.630
Grandpa!  Kaiba!  Mokuba!

00:13:07.340 --> 00:13:14.070
Yugi, Pegasus is more dangerous than you think.

00:13:19.810 --> 00:13:21.840
Honda, I'm scared!

00:13:22.060 --> 00:13:24.420
It's not scary!  Keep climbing!

00:13:24.420 --> 00:13:28.660
If she falls, we can't save her like this!

00:13:29.420 --> 00:13:30.620
Just keep climbing!

00:13:31.000 --> 00:13:33.420
Don't push me, Honda!

00:13:33.420 --> 00:13:35.120
Be quiet!  Climb faster!

00:13:35.460 --> 00:13:38.130
Grandpa, what do you mean?

00:13:38.660 --> 00:13:42.720
His heart is imprisoned by the shadows.

00:13:42.720 --> 00:13:46.510
A dark and deep Shadow World.

00:13:46.720 --> 00:13:48.240
Shadow World?

00:13:48.680 --> 00:13:53.740
Dark shadow powers form his core.

00:13:54.180 --> 00:13:58.750
You must battle against this giant darkness.

00:13:58.980 --> 00:14:05.390
The power of the shadows can take my life at any time.

00:14:07.050 --> 00:14:08.420
Grandpa!

00:14:08.660 --> 00:14:11.430
Yugi!

00:14:19.760 --> 00:14:21.340
That was scary.

00:14:21.340 --> 00:14:23.080
We don't have any time to waste.

00:14:23.080 --> 00:14:24.640
Let's hurry up and investigate.

00:14:32.510 --> 00:14:34.900
There's nothing here, Honda.

00:14:34.900 --> 00:14:36.120
That can't be.

00:14:36.540 --> 00:14:38.290
What's that?

00:14:39.980 --> 00:14:42.160
It looks like a painting.

00:14:42.160 --> 00:14:44.260
It's too dark to see clearly.

00:14:45.080 --> 00:14:45.830
Who is it?

00:14:52.800 --> 00:14:56.680
She's very pretty.  I wonder whose portrait it is.

00:14:56.900 --> 00:14:59.240
I saw the same picture in the living room.

00:14:59.680 --> 00:15:02.580
Does she have some relation to Pegasus?

00:15:08.480 --> 00:15:09.780
Pegasus!

00:15:10.480 --> 00:15:11.790
He caught us!

00:15:11.960 --> 00:15:15.590
I can see through all your plans.

00:15:15.800 --> 00:15:17.760
Then this should be a short discussion!

00:15:17.760 --> 00:15:21.240
Pegasus, we know you're cheating!

00:15:21.240 --> 00:15:23.730
It's pointless to hide the evidence!

00:15:25.160 --> 00:15:35.380
I don't need to do that because I'm from a world far beyond what you can imagine.

00:15:35.680 --> 00:15:36.880
What?

00:15:37.180 --> 00:15:42.020
I'll show you a glimpse of my world.

00:15:44.460 --> 00:15:45.400
What's going on?

00:15:45.400 --> 00:15:47.150
Honda, I'm scared!

00:15:49.360 --> 00:15:50.760
Grandpa!

00:15:56.430 --> 00:15:59.430
Grandpa!  Kaiba!  Mokuba!

00:16:07.360 --> 00:16:09.400
Where am I?

00:16:09.400 --> 00:16:11.340
What's that voice?

00:16:15.320 --> 00:16:16.820
Let's go see.

00:16:17.040 --> 00:16:17.840
But...

00:16:17.840 --> 00:16:20.090
It's pointless to stay here!

00:16:32.360 --> 00:16:34.170
What's this?

00:16:44.880 --> 00:16:47.140
What are they doing?

00:16:47.140 --> 00:16:49.400
Honda, let's go back.

00:16:49.400 --> 00:16:50.640
Look!

00:17:02.220 --> 00:17:04.460
You lose.

00:17:09.840 --> 00:17:11.070
They saw us!

00:17:13.920 --> 00:17:15.010
What should we do?

00:17:23.880 --> 00:17:25.150
Grandpa!

00:17:25.520 --> 00:17:28.440
Yugi, we believe in you.

00:17:28.440 --> 00:17:31.160
We know you'll save us.

00:17:31.560 --> 00:17:36.040
Yugi!

00:17:36.320 --> 00:17:39.930
Grandpa!

00:17:50.420 --> 00:17:51.840
What's going on?

00:17:52.720 --> 00:17:54.250
A Shadow Game.

00:17:54.460 --> 00:17:56.840
Shadow Game?  What is that?

00:17:58.080 --> 00:18:04.090
It's the ultimate game played secretly throughout history since ancient times.

00:18:04.300 --> 00:18:08.800
It's a Shadow World that only the chosen ones are allowed to witness.

00:18:09.200 --> 00:18:12.000
What's with his eye?

00:18:12.220 --> 00:18:15.970
Does his eye have something to do with the Shadow Games?

00:18:16.180 --> 00:18:19.440
It seems you've taken an interest in my eye.

00:18:20.240 --> 00:18:22.000
He read my mind?

00:18:22.000 --> 00:18:22.840
Impossible!

00:18:23.040 --> 00:18:24.520
You are correct.

00:18:24.520 --> 00:18:29.380
With this Millennium Eye, I can Mind Scan to read people's minds.

00:18:29.600 --> 00:18:32.620
As long as I have this power, I'm invincible.

00:18:33.080 --> 00:18:37.890
Only the chosen one is given this shadow power.

00:18:38.320 --> 00:18:41.390
Perhaps I'll read your mind next.

00:18:45.500 --> 00:18:47.000
What?  I can't read his mind!

00:18:51.640 --> 00:18:52.840
I found you.

00:18:53.120 --> 00:18:54.340
Are you...

00:19:08.980 --> 00:19:10.320
It was a dream.

00:19:15.720 --> 00:19:17.660
Why am I here?

00:19:22.560 --> 00:19:26.040
I'm back in my room.  Was it all just a dream?

00:19:26.680 --> 00:19:30.310
But I've heard of these Shadow Games before.

00:19:35.250 --> 00:19:38.250
I found the Millennium Eye.

00:19:52.160 --> 00:19:54.660
Now you'll be disqualified.

00:19:54.900 --> 00:19:56.940
Whatever, you jerk!

00:19:59.940 --> 00:20:02.940
You punk!  Don't talk so loud in your sleep!

00:20:04.280 --> 00:20:06.950
This is it!  I can defeat Yugi!

00:20:08.080 --> 00:20:10.450
I can't wait for tomorrow!

00:20:13.440 --> 00:20:15.720
It wasn't just a dream.

00:20:16.020 --> 00:20:19.200
It was a message from Grandpa.

00:20:20.020 --> 00:20:27.220
No matter what happens, I promise to save Kaiba, Mokuba and my grandpa!

00:20:35.300 --> 00:20:37.240
The finals have finally begun!

00:20:37.240 --> 00:20:40.960
Yugi's opponent in the first match is Mai Kujaku.

00:20:40.960 --> 00:20:45.000
Sorry Mai, but Yugi will win this match!

00:20:45.000 --> 00:20:46.920
Huh?  What's wrong, Yugi?

00:20:46.920 --> 00:20:49.500
You can't do anything against Mai's attacks?

00:20:49.500 --> 00:20:51.720
This isn't like you, Yugi!

00:20:51.720 --> 00:20:55.080
Please calm down and focus on the duel!

00:20:55.080 --> 00:20:58.920
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
Desperate Situation!
Shadow of Eyes

00:20:58.920 --> 00:21:00.520
Duel, standby!

00:21:04.990 --> 00:21:13.390
The flask glistens

00:21:14.430 --> 00:21:21.240
Wait for me in the science classroom

00:21:21.730 --> 00:21:30.210
If we put our cold hands together

00:21:30.910 --> 00:21:37.990
And rub them together, they become warm

00:21:39.690 --> 00:21:43.820
Shower of happiness

00:21:44.110 --> 00:21:47.930
I will shower you with it

00:21:48.260 --> 00:21:56.200
I will support you even when you feel lonely

00:21:56.400 --> 00:22:00.440
Shower of happiness

00:22:00.710 --> 00:22:04.570
You are not alone

00:22:04.950 --> 00:22:11.290
You're protected by a giant ring of friendship
